A firearm manufacturer operating out of [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. They specialize in particularly high-caliber, enchanted weapons. Their motto is "Just a tap'll do ya!" Their prototypes are still experimental: a gun of their make may burst after a shot.

Their people are androids, their working parts left bare where other androids wear skin: [[Org/Radiant Arms/People/Ichel|Ichel]], who keeps the berth, [[People/Utzil|Utzil]], who speaks for the company when she is away, and [[People/Pishan|Pishan]]. Their berth is a home with firearms hung as art and holes carved through its walls to fire from.

Aboard the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]] Radiant Arms first joined the Party's alliance while keeping its own fortified berth and Heart, [[Org/Radiant Arms/Final Caliber|Final Caliber]], as a forward base. It has since given both up: the Heart was plucked and fed to [[Org/Iconoclasm/Eerie|Eerie]], and the company's people moved to the Party's berth, where they hold the walls and shoot whatever comes. In return the Party gave them the next two rooms cut from its own Heart, and its help in gathering materials for Ichel's experiments. One of the rooms has become a firing range for testing their firearms; the other is kept for a distillery they mean to build, once the Party's Heart grows enough to make the upgrade.
